clonaut (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * English user interface: follows the system language, with a Language
    option in Settings and CLONAUT_LANG=en|it; Qt's own dialogs follow too.
  * AppImage for x86_64 and aarch64, with the official rclone as a fallback.
  * AUR packages clonaut and clonaut-git; signed release tags.
  * Choose which rclone to use: CLONAUT_RCLONE, a setting, PATH, or the
    AppImage copy, in this order; the About dialog shows the path.
  * Standard Python packaging (pip install ., python -m clonaut); AppStream
    metadata and PNG icons; desktop ID io.github.gradia64.Clonaut.
  * GitHub Actions: CI on every push, release workflow on signed tags with
    SHA256SUMS and build-provenance attestations.
  * Fix: scheduled transfers stopped running after closing the window (the
    tray kept the app alive without the rclone daemon); closing now quits.
  * Fix: an unresponsive rclone daemon is shown as an error instead of
    failing silently.
  * Fix: possible crash with PySide6 6.12.0 when Python's garbage collector
    ran in a background thread.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 09:52:40 +0100

clonaut (0.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public release on GitHub.
  * Scheduled transfers can be edited (right-click → Modifica…, or
    double-click the row); changes apply from the next run.
  * Help menu with an About dialog (Clonaut, rclone, Qt and Python
    versions); version shown in the window title.
  * Tray: a single left click brings the window to the front (or hides it
    when it is already in front); before, only the context menu worked.
  * README in English (Italian version in README.it.md); English package
    description and desktop entry, with Italian translations.
  * UI fixes: rclone version shown as "v1.75.2" instead of "vv1.75.2",
    dry-run rows show mode, source and destination, the new-remote form
    no longer keeps labels of the previous type nor scrolls sideways,
    wider new-transfer dialog.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0100

clonaut (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Nuovo nome: Clonaut (prima «GUI rclone», pacchetto gui-rclone).
    Impostazioni e programmazioni migrate da ~/.config/rclone-gui/.
  * Corretto: avvio con PyQt6 (dipendenza del pacchetto), spunta Cestino
    nel dialog di trasferimento, «Rimuovi completati» che non rimuoveva,
    righe duplicate dei trasferimenti programmati.
  * Sicurezza: credenziali del demone rcd passate via ambiente, non più
    visibili con ps.
  * Form dei remote: esempi modificabili (es. endpoint S3 personalizzati),
    opzioni duplicate unificate. Prova a vuoto: mostra anche le eliminazioni.
  * Varie: pulizia automatica dei log, uscita pulita dalla tray, «Avvia ora»
    anche in pausa, recurring.json corrotto non blocca l'avvio.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0100

clonaut (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Prima versione pacchettizzata: gestione remote con form dinamico
    (alias incluse nextcloud), trasferimenti copia/sposta/sincronizza con
    progressi, esclusioni per job, prova a vuoto onesta (--dry-run),
    cestino di sicurezza (--backup-dir), trasferimenti ripetuti
    programmati persistenti, icona nella tray con impostazioni.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:40:00 +0100
